<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>FDA shoulder geometry QA — local draft</title>
<style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font:15px system-ui;color:#dce9ec;background:#071b24}main{height:100vh;display:grid;grid-template-columns:290px 1fr}aside{padding:24px;background:#102a34;border-right:1px solid #35505a}h1{font-size:23px;line-height:1.2;margin:12px 0}p{line-height:1.55;color:#adc4cb}.tag{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#80c9cb}label{display:block;margin-top:24px;font-weight:600}select,button{font:inherit;padding:10px;border:1px solid #719098;border-radius:6px;background:#173a47;color:#fff;margin-top:10px}select{width:100%}button{cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #eab66b;outline-offset:3px}.hold{color:#edc39b;font-size:13px}#view{min-width:0;position:relative}canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}#status{position:absolute;bottom:20px;left:20px;right:20px;font-size:13px;color:#cfdee2;pointer-events:none}.legend{font-size:12px}strong{color:#eaf5f7}</style></head>
<body><main><aside><span class="tag">LOCAL GEOMETRY QA · NOT INSTALLED</span><h1>Independent shoulder reference</h1><p>FDA source assembly. No body or scan registration. Units and anatomical side remain unverified.</p>
<label for="part">Inspect source tissue</label><select id="part"><option value="all">All seven source parts</option><option value="joint">Joint tissues only</option><option value="Labrum">Labrum</option><option value="AC_Lig">Acromioclavicular ligament</option><option value="Gcart">Glenoid cartilage — constructed</option><option value="Hcart">Humeral cartilage — constructed</option><option value="CLAVICLE">Clavicle</option><option value="Humerus">Humerus</option><option value="SCAPULA">Scapula</option></select><button id="fit">Fit visible tissues</button>
<p class="hold">Glenoid cartilage source hold: three non-manifold vertices. No repair, smoothing, welding or decimation applied.</p><p class="legend">Bone: ivory · labrum: rose · cartilage: blue · ligament: amber.<br>Axes are source X/Y/Z, not validated anatomical directions.</p><p>Drag to rotate · wheel to zoom.<br><strong>Unvalidated prototype — not for clinical use.</strong></p></aside><section id="view" aria-label="Rotatable source shoulder geometry"><div id="status" role="status">Loading local source meshes…</div></section></main><script type="module" src="/app.js"></script></body></html>
